                                                "example_id": "1e271828-8663-4ffb-b9d6-98b5acc21e28",
                                                "sense_id": "87c9de91-83e2-306b-8c01-516ea4caeb2f",
                                                "text": "They just will not help you do the hard work of finding someone who actually wants your contract and the vintage flip phone that came with it."
